---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Release Notes"
  description="Scope of the Dama Image Prep product-photo workspace release."
  activeNav="/changelog/"
  ><header class="legal-hero legal-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">DAMA IMAGE PREP</p><h1>Release Notes</h1>
  </header><section class="legal-content legal-shell">
    <h2>Image workspace release — September 7, 2026</h2><ul>
      <li>
        Replaced the previous woodworking utility with a focused product-photo
        workspace.
      </li><li>
        Added local batch resize, fit/padding and positioned fill/crop.
      </li><li>
        Added JPG, PNG and WebP output, safe sequence filenames, individual
        downloads and ZIP export.
      </li><li>
        Added three illustrative thumbnail crop previews and optional
        browser-saved settings.
      </li><li>
        Added supported-format checks, pixel and byte limits, sequential
        processing and recoverable file errors.
      </li><li>
        Added six technical guides, explicit limitations and privacy
        explanations.
      </li>
    </ul><p>
      Old subject-specific URLs have no equivalent in the new service and return
      the not-found page. They are not misleadingly redirected to unrelated
      content.
    </p><p>
      <a href="/standards/">Current methods and verification scope</a> · <a
        href="/">Open workspace</a>
    </p>
  </section></BaseLayout
>
